~ portrait
A portrait of a man.
He looks like a noble?
There are some notes on the table in front of it.

- Read
	"I've begun to notice something strange about this world..."
	"There are things that seem to exist, yet cannot be seen."
	"There must be something we all fail to perceive..."
	"I have to uncover the truth."

	...
	"xx32 06/14"
	"It must be my fault... does my experiment went wrong?"
	"How could this happen...?"

	...
	"xx33 11/23"
	"[shake rate=40 level=10]THIS CAN'T BE REAL[/shake]"
	"[shake rate=40 level=10]OUR LIVES... THEY'RE JUST A GAME[/shake]"
	"[shake rate=40 level=10]SOMETHING IS TERRIBLY WRONG[/shake]"
	"[shake rate=40 level=10]I WON'T LET THEM CONTROL ME[/shake]"

	The handwriting becomes distorted. The lower half is unreadable.

	...
	"xx34 02/18"
	"You are our hope... please, save us..."

	...
	"I'll just give up..."
	"It doesn't matter anymore."
	"I left the device at the back of this room..."
	"...for those who still want to seek the truth."
	=> END
- Leave
	=> END

